**Unscoped retryCount filter deletes non-SMS workflow reminders**

Placing `method: WorkflowMethods.SMS` inside only the first branch of `OR` leaves `{ retryCount: { gt: 1 } }` matching all workflow reminders. Any reminder method (EMAIL, WHATSAPP) with more than one retry will be deleted by this SMS scheduler. Move `method: WorkflowMethods.SMS` to the top level of the `where` clause:

```ts
where: {
  method: WorkflowMethods.SMS,
  OR: [
    {
      scheduledDate: {
        lte: dayjs().toISOString(),
      },
    },
    {
      retryCount: {
        gt: 1,
      },
    },
  ],
},
```

